"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24T06:26:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T10:45:31Z","closed_at":"2026-04-15T10:45:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.1.stable.steam [14d19694e]\n\n### System information\n\nOS: Windows 11 - Godot: v4.6.1.stable (Compatibility renderer) - CPU: AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D - GPU: GeForce RTX 5070 Ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you want to read the SDF normals generated by LightOccluder2D nodes in a shader using [texture_sdf_normal()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.html#sdf-functions), texture_sdf() needs to be explicitly used in the final shader output. The problem is that you don't always need the signed distance value returned by the texture_sdf function.\n\nThis is a bigger issue for VisualShaders, since having a VisualShaderNodeTextureSDF is not enough. The node has to be connected to the final output node somehow.\n\nAfter some testing, it seems like as long as ANY shader performs the texture lookup using texture_sdf(), the shader will work. Video example:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t0yOnlvIcdA\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the minimal reproduction project I've included 2 shaders which showcase the issue:\n\n1. A typical shader with texture_sdf() commented out, removing the comment will fix the rendering of both materials.\n2. A VisualShader with the VisualShaderNodeTextureSDF disconnected from the output node. Linking the node to the output in any arbitrary way will fix the rendering of both materials.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[sdf-normal-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26202078/sdf-normal-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117783/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}